From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mckenna654 <mckenna654@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:36:33 +1100
Subject: Use gentle wording for fainting and losing

Pokemon are 'tired' rather than fainted, and losing a battle says the
Pokemon need a little rest. Shortens the nurse and Mum recovery speeches.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/data/text/white_out.inc b/data/text/white_out.inc
index 1d00c1e10..3dcadb6f7 100644
--- a/data/text/white_out.inc
+++ b/data/text/white_out.inc
@@ -1,44 +1,24 @@
 Text_FirstShouldRestoreMonsHealth::
-	.string "First, you should restore your\n"
-	.string "POKéMON to full health.$"
+	.string "Let's make your POKéMON\n"
+	.string "feel better!$"
 
 Text_MonsHealedShouldBuyPotions::
-	.string "Your POKéMON have been healed\n"
-	.string "to perfect health.\p"
-	.string "If your POKéMON's energy, HP,\n"
-	.string "is down, please come see us.\p"
-	.string "If you're planning to go far in the\n"
-	.string "field, you should buy some POTIONS\l"
-	.string "at the POKéMON MART.\p"
-	.string "We hope you excel!$"
+	.string "All better!\p"
+	.string "Good luck!$"
 
 Text_MonsHealed::
-	.string "Your POKéMON have been healed\n"
-	.string "to perfect health.\p"
-	.string "We hope you excel!$"
+	.string "All better!\p"
+	.string "Good luck!$"
 
 Text_HadQuiteAnExperienceTakeRest::
 	.string "MOM: {PLAYER}!\n"
 	.string "Welcome home.\p"
-	.string "It sounds like you had quite\n"
-	.string "an experience.\p"
-	.string "Maybe you should take a quick\n"
-	.string "rest.$"
+	.string "Have a little rest.$"
 
 Text_MomExplainHPGetPotions::
-	.string "MOM: Oh, good! You and your\n"
-	.string "POKéMON are looking great.\p"
-	.string "I just heard from PROF. OAK.\p"
-	.string "He said that POKéMON's energy is\n"
-	.string "measured in HP.\p"
-	.string "If your POKéMON lose their HP,\n"
-	.string "you can restore them at any\l"
-	.string "POKéMON CENTER.\p"
-	.string "If you're going to travel far away,\n"
-	.string "the smart TRAINER stocks up on\l"
-	.string "POTIONS at the POKéMON MART.\p"
-	.string "Make me proud, honey!\p"
-	.string "Take care!$"
+	.string "MOM: All better!\p"
+	.string "Your POKéMON look great.\p"
+	.string "Have fun, honey!$"
 
 Text_WhitedOutLostMoney::
 	.string "{PLAYER} is out of usable\n"
@@ -48,6 +28,5 @@ Text_WhitedOutLostMoney::
 	.string "{PLAYER} whited out!$"
 
 Text_WhitedOut::
-	.string "{PLAYER} is out of usable\n"
-	.string "POKéMON!\p"
-	.string "{PLAYER} whited out!$"
+	.string "Your POKéMON need\n"
+	.string "a little rest!$"
